/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 646.0149999999998727 Td
(Completed sale invoices only; cancelled bills are excluded.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 635.0149999999998727 Td
(Sale returns are NOT netted: these are GROSS sales figures.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 624.0149999999998727 Td
(Amounts are in rupees; weights are in grams.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 613.0149999999998727 Td
(STN.WT \(ALL\) and STN.VAL. \(ALL\) include diamonds; diamonds cannot be separated out.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 602.0149999999998727 Td
(Not available \(not recorded when the bill is saved\): GS WT TYPE \(weight unit\), DIA.WT / DIA.VAL, LBR.VAL \(labour is merged with other charges\), MKG CHARGE DISC.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 591.0149999999998727 Td
(MET.VAL. is the metal value of the line \(amount before discount less stone, making, other charges, value add and mark-up\). Every line has it.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 580.0149999999998727 Td
(MKG CHARGE, LABOUR & OTHER, VALUE ADD and MARK UP are line values \(per-piece figure x qty\). LABOUR & OTHER is labour and other charges together: they are saved merged, so labour alone is not available. LINE DISC is the per-line discount in rupees.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 569.0149999999998727 Td
(WEIGHT COLUMNS ARE PER PIECE as entered at the counter, so a line with QTY above 1 shows the weight of ONE PIECE, not the line total. A line billed straight from a stock lot without typed weights may instead hold the lot or line weight. This is how the bills are stored; it is not a rounding of this report.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 558.0149999999998727 Td
(On a bill marked TAX INCL. the value columns \(MET.VAL., STN.VAL., MKG CHARGE, LABOUR & OTHER, VALUE ADD, MARK UP, LINE DISC\) are the amounts as entered and therefore INCLUDE GST, while TAXABLE VAL is ex-tax: on those bills the value columns do not add up to TAXABLE VAL. The same is true of any) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 547.0149999999998727 Td
(bill carrying a BILL-LEVEL discount, inclusive or not: that discount lowers TAXABLE VAL and leaves the value columns as entered.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 536.0149999999998727 Td
(SUPPLY TYPE is taken from the tax actually charged on the line \(IGST = Inter, CGST/SGST = Intra\), not from the states. SUPPLY CHECK compares it with the firm and customer states and says CHECK where they disagree. PLACE OF SUPPLY is the customer's state on file \(blank for a walk-in\). B2B means the customer) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 525.0149999999998727 Td
(has a GSTIN on file, otherwise B2C. TAX RATE % is derived from the charged tax over the taxable value \(no rate is stored\); it is shown as a GST slab only when paisa rounding of the charged tax proves exactly one slab, otherwise the exact derived rate is shown, so a mis-taxed line cannot hide behind a tidy figure on any) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 514.0149999999998727 Td
(line of normal size \(under about Rs 1 a wrong rate can still fall within a paisa of a slab\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 503.0149999999999295 Td
(Charged tax type agrees with the states wherever both are known.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 492.0149999999999295 Td
(TCS u/s 206C\(1H\) is not in this report and not inside TOTAL: it is not stored on the invoice, only as separate ledger entries, so no figure is shown.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 481.0149999999999295 Td
(TAG NO is the barcode of the stock item sold; blank means a line typed by hand, with no stock item. INV and NO are the INV NO split at its last - or /.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 470.0149999999999295 Td
(A row named "Loose metal \(bill header\)" is metal sold on the bill header: taxed on the bill but not an item line. It is added so the bill agrees with its own stored figures.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 459.0149999999999295 Td
(Every invoice agrees with its own lines.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
24. 448.0149999999999295 Td
(CASH, BANK \(cheque\), CARD, ONLINE, PREVIOUS AMT, ROUND OFF, TOTAL DISC and GSTIN belong to the bill, not the line: shown on the first line of each bill and totalled once per bill.) Tj
ET
BT
